        <span class="win__big">Best Byron Bay Film</span>
        <span class="win__what"><span class="serif">Flowing Wood</span>, Byron Bay International Film Festival 2025</span>
        <span class="win__panel">
          <span class="win__stats">
            <span><strong>4</strong> film festivals</span>
            <span><strong>3</strong> countries</span>
            <span><strong>1</strong> award</span>
